<title>GERMANY: Conti H1 pre-tax profit more than doubles.</title>
<headline>Conti H1 pre-tax profit more than doubles.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     120     vs 58</p>
<p>    Group sales				  5,092   vs 5,030</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German tyre-maker is Continental AG.</p>
